# Allow GitHub Actions workflows so CI config can be committed.
# Keep agents/, prompts/, copilot-instructions.md, etc. untracked (they
# remain covered by the .github/* ignore above).
!.github/workflows/
!.github/workflows/**
# Allow .github/scripts/* (check-ai-provider-endpoints.sh,
# check-doc-links.sh, check-translations.sh) so the CI jobs can
# invoke them. Without this, new helper scripts are silently
# ignored and the calling job fails with exit 127.
!.github/scripts/
!.github/scripts/**
# Document the active branch protection Ruleset alongside this file.
!.github/RULESET.md
