# === Agent helper scripts and build verification artifacts (2026-08-23) ===
# The agent that built the new app icon and resolved the @swc/helpers
# standalone build fix created a series of .git-tmp-*.py / .git-tmp-*.log
# helper files at the workspace root and inside apps/desktop/build. They
# are transient debug artifacts and should never be committed.
.git-tmp-*
# 1024x1024 PNG used as a master source when generating icon.ico. Not
# needed at runtime — the .ico is the actual deliverable, and the
# generator script (if needed again) can re-create this from git history.
apps/desktop/build/icon-master.png
# Visual previews of every ICO size (used to verify contrast on light
# and dark taskbars before packaging). Regenerable from icon.ico + a
# 10-line Pillow script.
apps/desktop/build/.icon-preview/
# Stale release/ outputs from interrupted builds. The prebuild script
# renames these to release.__stale_<timestamp>__/ when a file lock
# (antivirus / Windows Search indexer) blocks the rmSync of the normal
# release/ dir. They are safe to delete manually once the new build
# is verified.
apps/desktop/release.__stale*/
